{
 "id": "create:deployer/filter",
 "schematic": "deployer/filter",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Using the Deployer",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "Given Rotational Force, a Deployer can imitate player interactions",
  "text_2": "It will always interact with the position 2 blocks in front of itself",
  "text_3": "Blocks directly in front will not obstruct it",
  "text_4": "Deployers can:",
  "text_5": "Place Blocks,",
  "text_6": "Use Items,",
  "text_7": "Activate Blocks,",
  "text_8": "Harvest blocks",
  "text_9": "and Attack Mobs",
  "text_10": "Right-click the front to give it an Item to use",
  "text_11": "Items can also be inserted automatically",
  "text_12": "Deployers carry a filter slot",
  "text_13": "When a filter is set, it activates only while holding a matching item",
  "text_14": "Only items matching the filter can now be inserted...",
  "text_15": "...and only non-matching items will be extracted"
 },
 "tags": [
  "create:kinetic_appliances"
 ],
